# Formatter ownership contract: Biome owns the TS family (see biome.json);
# a repo-wide Prettier run must never cross that boundary, nor touch
# lockfiles, husky's generated shims, or file types outside Prettier's scope
# here (markdown/yaml/shell/Dockerfile). Ignore files are excluded too:
# prettier-plugin-sh only supports them best-effort (negation patterns can
# be mangled).
*.ts
*.tsx
*.js
*.jsx
*.json
*.jsonc

.claude/worktrees/
.husky/_

.dockerignore
.gitignore

bun.lock
